# Force apex → www (primary canonical host)
https://sandhillstorage.com/*  https://www.sandhillstorage.com/:splat  301!

# Retire the old IdeaTek domain. It was an alias on this site serving a full
# duplicate copy; GA4 (90d) had it carrying more traffic than the canonical
# host (798 sessions vs 547). Path-preserving 301 to Sand Hills.
#
# These MUST stay above the clean-URL 200 rewrites at the bottom of this file.
# Netlify matches top-down and a 200 rewrite is terminal, so if /faq resolves
# first the visitor is served the page on the old domain and never crosses over.
https://ideatekstorage.com/*      https://www.sandhillstorage.com/:splat  301!
https://www.ideatekstorage.com/*  https://www.sandhillstorage.com/:splat  301!
http://ideatekstorage.com/*       https://www.sandhillstorage.com/:splat  301!
http://www.ideatekstorage.com/*   https://www.sandhillstorage.com/:splat  301!

# Legacy IdeaTek paths → new Sand Hills pages (for traffic from old GBP listings,
# bookmarks, search results, etc.). Works for both ideatekstorage.com (when
# aliased / forwarded to this site) and any inbound link to /pages/<x>.
/pages/sandhill         /locations/hutchinson            301!
/pages/southhutchinson  /locations/south-hutchinson      301!
/pages/buhler           /locations/buhler                301!
/pages/haven            /locations/haven                 301!
/pages/loginpay         /                                301!
/pages/*                /                                301!

# Legacy → new slug: north-hutchinson renamed to hutchinson
